Package: morar
Title: Housing Affordability Analysis for Brazil
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Vinicius", "Oike", , "viniciusoike@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Mortgage and housing affordability calculations following
    Brazilian market conventions. Implements SAC, Price and mixed
    amortization, effective and nominal rates, insurance (MIP and DFI) and
    administrative fees, the inversion between income and maximum
    financeable price, full amortization schedules, and affordability
    indices (HAI and price-to-income ratio). Core functions are vectorized
    so they apply to entire income or price distributions.
